        <div class="bg-bae-card border border-bae-border rounded-bae p-5">
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-bae-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">CLIENT HANDOFF</div>
          <div class="text-xl font-bold text-bae-ink mb-1">Freelance Web Developer: client handoff</div>
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-bae-primary font-serif mb-2">ICO + SVG + HTML</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-bae-muted leading-relaxed">Clients always forget to brief a favicon. I upload their logo, generate the full pack, and drop the HTML snippet straight into their <head>. The dark mode preview means I never ship a favicon that disappears on dark tabs.</p>
