          <p class="text-sm text-bae-muted leading-relaxed">Building a Progressive Web App requires 192×192 and 512×512 PNGs for the manifest, plus an apple-touch-icon. The Best Answer Hub Favicon Generator outputs all the sizes I need in one download so I can cross the favicon checklist off in one go.</p>
